    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McKenna Healy are delighted to present this exceptional three-bedroom end-of-terrace family home to the market, perfectly positioned within the highly sought-after Tayleur's Point development in the heart of Rush.\n\nOccupying an enviable position overlooking a spacious open green, this outstanding home has been lovingly maintained and thoughtfully upgraded by its original owners, resulting in a property presented in true turnkey, showhouse condition. Every detail has been carefully considered, from the beautifully tiled entrance with manicured flower beds and elegant plantation shutters to the stylish interiors that effortlessly combine timeless elegance with modern family living.\n\nFurther enhancing the home's appeal are the significant energy efficiency improvements, including a B3 BER rating, full external insulation wrap and a recently installed gas boiler, offering excellent comfort and reduced running costs throughout the year.\n\nThe bright and spacious accommodation has been designed with modern family life in mind. A welcoming entrance hallway with elegant marble flooring sets the tone on arrival and leads to a beautifully appointed kitchen and dining room, also finished with luxurious marble flooring and overlooking the landscaped front garden. To the rear, a generous living room is bathed in natural light and features French doors opening onto a wonderfully landscaped west-facing rear garden, creating the perfect setting for both everyday family life and entertaining.\n\nUpstairs, the property offers three generously proportioned bedrooms, including a superb principal bedroom complete with a recently refurbished contemporary en-suite wet room. A stylish family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms, completing the first-floor accommodation.\n\nThe outdoor space is equally impressive. The private west-facing rear garden has been beautifully landscaped with mature planting, colourful flower beds and an excellent side entrance, creating a wonderfully secluded outdoor sanctuary to enjoy from afternoon through to evening sunshine.\n\nTayleur's Point is one of Rush's most desirable residential developments, ideally located just moments from the picturesque harbour and within a gentle stroll of the village's vibrant Main Street, where an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops and everyday amenities can be enjoyed. Rush is a thriving coastal community renowned for its beautiful beaches, scenic coastal walks and exceptional range of sporting facilities, including golf, sailing, GAA, soccer and tennis clubs. Families are particularly well catered for with an excellent choice of both primary and secondary schools nearby.\n\nFor commuters, the location is second to none, with regular bus services and Rush & Lusk train station providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre. The M1, M50 and Dublin Airport are all within easy reach, making this an ideal location for those seeking the perfect balance of relaxed coastal living and city convenience.\n\nBeautifully presented, exceptionally maintained and enjoying an enviable position within this mature and highly regarded development, this outstanding home offers purchasers a rare opportunity to acquire a property where style, quality, energy efficiency and location come together seamlessly."
      },
